{"availability":"available","full":"bookorbit/bookorbit","name":"bookorbit","description":"BookOrbit: Your Reading Space","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":5276,"forks":344,"created":"2026-05-09T00:04:37Z","updated":"2026-10-08T13:58:51Z","license":"AGPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://bookorbit.app","topics":["audiobook-player","digital-library","docker","ebook-reader","library-management","metadata-management","nestjs","oidc-single-sign-on","opds","self-hosted","vue"],"demo":"https://demo.bookorbit.app/magic?token=2d92cb900e184cf0eb8b11f72cffc6011673d1016e1b300d750eb3d76abc1572","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T16:05:48.668Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T16:05:48.668Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T16:05:48.668Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-05T19:23:25.785Z","stars":5194,"forks":340},{"at":"2026-10-07T20:13:59.172Z","stars":5256,"forks":343},{"at":"2026-10-08T16:05:48.668Z","stars":5276,"forks":344}],"technologies":["Node.js","Vue"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A self-hosted library and reading platform for ebooks, PDFs, audiobooks, and comics.","Overview &bull; Live Demo &bull; iOS & Apple Watch &bull; Features &bull; Quick Start &bull; Managed Hosting &bull; KOReader &bull; Docs","BookOrbit organizes your books and lets you enjoy them anywhere: on iPhone, Apple Watch, the web, Kobo, or KOReader. Your reading progress, highlights, and status stay synchronized, so you can start a chapter in one place and continue in another."],"features":["Built-in Web Readers: Ebooks (EPUB, KEPUB, MOBI, AZW3, AZW, FB2), PDFs, comics (CBZ, CBR, CB7), and audiobooks (M4B, MP3, M4A, OPUS, OGG, FLAC), with no extra plugins required.","Native iPhone & Apple Watch Apps: Read, listen, download, upload, and synchronize with your BookOrbit server from a native, offline-capable iPhone app. Send audiobooks to Apple Watch for independent offline playback and…","Three-Way Sync (Kobo + KOReader + BookOrbit): Progress and annotations flow bidirectionally between Kobo devices, KOReader, and the BookOrbit web reader. Pick up on any surface where you left off on another, including…","KOReader Plugin: An on-device catalog browser with search, download, and status and rating management, alongside full progress and annotation sync.","Annotations & Highlights: Highlights from the web reader, KOReader, and Kobo merge into one searchable hub. Filter by color, style, and source; export as Markdown, CSV, or JSON."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bookorbit/bookorbit/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"035ab803720b91261beb0f666f59177a6cbea32eb814d9d208e0e0d8e18d6798","extractedAt":"2026-10-07T21:26:25.502Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T16:05:48.779Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A self-hosted library and reading platform for ebooks, PDFs, audiobooks, and comics.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bookorbit/bookorbit/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"not_required","text":"No account required.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bookorbit/bookorbit/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"035ab803720b91261beb0f666f59177a6cbea32eb814d9d208e0e0d8e18d6798","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bookorbit/bookorbit/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T16:05:48.780Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-08T13:58:51Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bookorbit/bookorbit/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T16:05:48.781Z","hash":"035ab803720b91261beb0f666f59177a6cbea32eb814d9d208e0e0d8e18d6798","originalBytes":15444,"storedBytes":15444,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["bookorbit","docs","reading","koreader","apple","book","watch","library","progress","sync","iphone","see","bull","download","full","kobo","read","setup","books","github","open","playback","support","web","app","audiobooks","browser","data","demo","hardcover","highlights","images","live","native","one","plugin","requests",